flowchart LR
  board_run[后台循环<br/>Board.run] -->|每 2 秒| fetch_agents[拉权威会话列表<br/>C.fetch_agents]
  fetch_agents -->|子进程| claude_cli[[claude agents --json]]
  board_run -->|每 1 秒| build[组装看板<br/>Board.build]
  build -->|覆盖 status| refresh[用状态文件刷新<br/>C.refresh_from_files]
  refresh -->|读| sessions_dir[("会话状态文件<br/>~/.claude/sessions/")]
  build -->|分桶| group[分组 + 刚完成保鲜<br/>C.group_agents]
  group -->|逐个判| classify[判状态<br/>C.classify]
  group -->|status_since 读| sessions_dir
  build -->|每个会话| describe[标题 / 子代理<br/>describe + MetaCache]
  describe -->|增量读| projects_dir[("对话记录 jsonl<br/>~/.claude/projects/")]
  build -->|glob 最近 24 小时| projects_dir
  board_run -->|序列化写入| payload[(缓存 JSON<br/>Board.payload)]
  api_sessions[接口<br/>GET /api/sessions] -->|加锁读| payload
  poll[前端轮询 每 1.5 秒<br/>poll] -->|HTTP| api_sessions
  poll -->|提示音 / 标签页图标| observe[提醒<br/>CCAlert.observe]
  poll -->|renderBunks| pick[选 Clawd 动画<br/>Clawd.pick]

